DTSTAMP:20260712T000000Z
DTSTART:20260712T060000Z
DTEND:20260712T100000Z
SUMMARY:Silver Rush 50 Run
DESCRIPTION:The Life Time Silver Rush 50 Run is a high-altitude 50-mile trail race that takes runners through the historic mining district of Leadville. The out-and-back course reaches elevations of over 12\,000 feet and serves as a qualifier for the Leadville Trail 100 Run.
LOCATION:316 Harrison Ave\, Leadville\, CO 80461
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
