DESCRIPTION:A true mountain race set in State Forest State Park\, featuring rugged alpine ridge running and technically challenging singletrack. The course travels between the Never Summer and Medicine Bow Mountains\, offering constant views of rocky peaks and high alpine lakes.
LOCATION:Gould Community Center\, 56750 CO-14\, Walden\, CO 80480
STATUS:CONFIRMED
