DTEND:20260725T110000Z
SUMMARY:Staunton Trail Race
DESCRIPTION:Trail race at Staunton State Park offering 5K and 10 mile distances. Registration check-in starts at 6am at Ranch Hand parking lot just past the Visitor's Center. Day of registration price increases by $5.
LOCATION:Staunton State Park\, Ranch Hand parking lot\, Evergreen\, CO 80439
