BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:rocky-mountain-half-marathon-5k-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20260712T000000Z
DTSTART:20260731T180000Z
DTEND:20260731T220000Z
SUMMARY:Rocky Mountain Half Marathon & 5K
DESCRIPTION:A challenging but scenic run just outside Rocky Mountain National Park. The 5K runs counterclockwise around Lake Estes on paved roads with an initial aggressive climb followed by downhill and flat terrain. The half marathon (13.1 miles) starts near Community Drive and Highway 36\, heading counter-clockwise around Lake Estes with elevation gain of +1\,267 ft. Features stunning mountain views\, 5 aid stations for the half marathon\, and finishes by the lake at the fairgrounds in historic Estes Park\, Colorado with views of the Continental Divide.
LOCATION:Stanley Park Ball Field\, Estes Park\, CO
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:wild-west-relay-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20260712T000000Z
DTSTART:20260731T050000Z
DTEND:20260731T090000Z
SUMMARY:Wild West Relay
DESCRIPTION:A scenic point-to-point relay race across Colorado starting in Fort Collins and finishing 200 miles away in Steamboat Springs. Teams of 1-12 runners choose from four team categories: 12-person team\, Ultra team (4-6 runners)\, Super Ultra team (1-3 runners)\, or High School Team. Runners navigate mountain passes\, open spaces\, and roads. The race runs from Friday July 31st (5 AM start) through Saturday August 1st (finish by 4 PM). This is a 'Rules of the Road' race where traffic is not halted for runners.
LOCATION:Budweiser Brewing Plant (Anheuser Busch Facility)\, Fort Collins\, CO 80524
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:berry-picker-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20260712T000000Z
DTSTART:20260801T080000Z
DTEND:20260801T120000Z
SUMMARY:Berry Picker
DESCRIPTION:Part of the Vail Trail Running Series featuring scenic mountain trails through forests and streams.
LOCATION:Vail\, CO
STATUS:CONFIRMED
