BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:rocky-mountain-half-marathon-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20260712T000000Z
DTSTART:20260801T060000Z
DTEND:20260801T100000Z
SUMMARY:Rocky Mountain Half Marathon
DESCRIPTION:A challenging but scenic race just outside Rocky Mountain National Park\, starting and finishing near Lake Estes at the fairgrounds in historic Estes Park\, Colorado. The weekend event includes a 5K on Friday evening (July 31) and a Half Marathon on Saturday morning (August 1). An 'Elk Double' challenge option is available for runners who complete both distances. The half marathon features a paved road loop with +1\,267 ft / -1\,263 ft elevation change and a 4-hour time limit. The 5K is a counterclockwise loop around Lake Estes with +156 ft elevation. Stunning views of the Continental Divide and Rocky Mountain National Park throughout.
LOCATION:Stanley Park Ball Field\, Estes Park\, CO
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
