DESCRIPTION:Mt. Sneffels Half Marathon\, 10K\, and Kids Fun Run held in Ouray\, Colorado\, known as the 'Switzerland of America'. Proceeds benefit the Mount Sneffels Education Foundation\, which has funded over $1.5 million into programs enriching the lives of Ouray County children since 1992.
