BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:santa-cruz-trail-run-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20260712T000000Z
DTSTART:20260822T083000Z
DTEND:20260822T123000Z
SUMMARY:Santa Cruz Trail Run
DESCRIPTION:Trail run featuring giant redwoods with single track and expansive roads. Courses include river crossings and high ridges with aid stations every 5-6 miles. Post-race food and family-friendly activities at Henry Cowell Park.
LOCATION:Henry Cowell Redwoods State Park\, Felton\, CA
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:staunton-rocks-marathon-half-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20260712T000000Z
DTSTART:20260822T070000Z
DTEND:20260822T110000Z
SUMMARY:Staunton Rocks! Marathon & Half
DESCRIPTION:An event put on by trail runners for trail runners\, touring the renowned singletrack of Staunton State Park in Colorado's Front Range Mountains southwest of Denver. The marathon features 4\,500 ft of vertical gain over 26.3 miles (90% singletrack\, 10% dirt road) with elevation ranging from 8\,200' to 9\,500'. The half marathon covers 13.1 miles with 2\,200 ft of vertical gain. The course showcases historic buildings\, old milling operations\, 60+ mile views\, scenic lakes and streams\, and abundant wildlife. Race includes fully stocked aid stations\, gender-specific race t-shirt\, finisher awards\, free race photos\, finish line meal\, and professional medical coverage. Time allowances: Marathon 10 hours\, Half Marathon 9 hours.
LOCATION:Staunton State Park\, Pine\, Colorado
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:bergen-peak-trail-race-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20260712T000000Z
DTSTART:20260822T070000Z
DTEND:20260822T110000Z
SUMMARY:Bergen Peak Trail Race
DESCRIPTION:Come run with us in beautiful Evergreen to the top of Bergen Peak at gorgeous Elk Meadow Park! This race day will offer a 5K race running through the lower sections of Elk Meadow Park or a Half Marathon to the top of Bergen Peak. Registration Check-in starts at 6am at the Elk Meadow trailhead access at Buchanan Park Rec Center. Races will start promptly at 7am.
LOCATION:32003 Ellingwood Trail\, Evergreen\, CO 80439
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:leadville-trail-100-run-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20260712T000000Z
DTSTART:20260822T040000Z
DTEND:20260822T080000Z
SUMMARY:Leadville Trail 100 Run
DESCRIPTION:The Life Time Leadville Trail 100 RUN presented by La Sportiva is one of the oldest and most storied endurance running events in the world. This 100-mile out-and-back ultramarathon through the Colorado Rockies features over 15\,000 feet of elevation gain with a high point of 12\,526 feet at Hope Pass. The race starts at 10\,200 feet and is known as the 'Race Across the Sky.' Runners have 30 hours to complete the course to earn a finisher buckle.
LOCATION:Corner of 6th St & Harrison\, Leadville\, CO
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
