UID:mudgirl-denver-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20260712T000000Z
DTSTART:20260829T083000Z
DTEND:20260829T123000Z
SUMMARY:Mudgirl Denver
DESCRIPTION:Mudgirl is an obstacle race dedicated to women. The Denver event takes place August 29-30\, 2026 at Colorado National Speedway. Race includes obstacles\, festival activities\, finisher medals\, and post-race festivities. Minimum age 7 years old (ages 7-13 must be accompanied by an adult).
LOCATION:4281 County Road 10\, Dacono\, CO 80514\, United States
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:grand-traverse-mountain-run-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20260712T000000Z
DTSTART:20260905T060000Z
DTEND:20260905T100000Z
SUMMARY:Grand Traverse Mountain Run
DESCRIPTION:A 40-mile point-to-point ultramarathon from Crested Butte to Aspen across the Elk Mountains with over 6\,000 feet of elevation gain. Follows the route of the Grand Traverse Backcountry Ski race. Operated as a fundraising event for CrestedButte Nordic\, a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization. Registration opens December 1\, 2026 at midnight.
LOCATION:Start: Town Park\, Crested Butte\, CO | Finish: Ajax Park\, 1001 S. Ute Ave\, Aspen\, CO
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:the-grand-traverse-bike-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20260712T000000Z
DTSTART:20260906T080000Z
DTEND:20260906T120000Z
SUMMARY:The Grand Traverse (Bike)
DESCRIPTION:The Grand Traverse Bike is a 40-mile point-to-point mountain bike race from Crested Butte to Aspen\, CO. Part of the Grand Traverse Triple Crown series (Ski\, Run\, Bike)\, the race is operated as a fundraising event for Crested Butte Nordic\, a 501(c)(3) non-profit. The route is partially based on historic mail routes connecting the Colorado mining towns of Crested Butte and Aspen from the 1880s. General registration opens at midnight on December 1st.
LOCATION:Crested Butte\, CO to Aspen\, CO
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
